@startuml System Architecture Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title System Architecture Diagram

package "Frontend Layer" {
  [React Application] as React
  [Firebase Hosting] as Firebase
  React ..> Firebase : Deployed on
}

package "Backend Layer" {
  [Express.js Server] as Express
  [Render Platform] as Render
  Express ..> Render : Deployed on
}

package "Database Layer" {
  [PostgreSQL Database] as Postgres
  [Supabase Hosting] as Supabase
  Postgres ..> Supabase : Hosted on
}

package "External Services" {
  [Google Maps API] as Maps
  [Socket.io WebSocket] as Socket
}

React --> Express : HTTP/REST API
React --> Socket : WebSocket Connection
Express --> Postgres : Prisma ORM
Express --> Socket : WebSocket Server
React --> Maps : Location Services

note right of React
  Technologies:
  - React 18 + TypeScript
  - Vite Build Tool
  - Tailwind CSS
  - React Router
  - Socket.io Client
end note

note right of Express
  Technologies:
  - Node.js Runtime
  - Express.js Framework
  - JWT Authentication
  - bcryptjs Hashing
  - Prisma ORM
  - Socket.io Server
end note

note right of Postgres
  Features:
  - ACID Compliance
  - Connection Pooling
  - Indexed Queries
  - Transaction Support
end note

@enduml

